# Artifacts produced by `make` in this directory (see ./Makefile).
#
# Committed sources are: Makefile, raw_cbor.patch, sgx_cbor.patch and the libcbor
# submodule. Everything below is generated by the build and must not be committed.
#
# - sgx_libcbor/ : a `cp -r libcbor sgx_libcbor` copy that then gets patched with
#                  sgx_cbor.patch (trusted/enclave build of libcbor).
# - untrusted/   : CMake build + `make install` output tree (CBOR_DIR), removed by
#                  `make clean`.
# - trusted/     : CMake build + `make install` output tree (SGX_CBOR_DIR), removed
#                  by `make clean`.

/sgx_libcbor/
/trusted/
/untrusted/
